695 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 97 0 R
/T (4. Standard modules: math gives functions such as floor\(\), isfinite\(\); decimal gives the exact Decimal type and rounding modes. They are installed with Python, imported with 'import math' / 'from decimal import Decimal'. 5. Module search: Python looks for a module in sys.modules \(already imported\), then in the folder of the running script \(sys.path[0]\), then the other folders listed in sys.path \(PYTHONPATH, standard library, site-packages\) - the first match wins. So milkrate.py must be in the same folder as the script \(or in a folder on sys.path\), and you should not name your file like a standard module \(e.g. math.py\) because it would be found first.)
/E (4. Standard modules: math gives functions such as floor\(\), isfinite\(\); decimal gives the exact Decimal type and rounding modes. They are installed with Python, imported with 'import math' / 'from decimal import Decimal'. 5. Module search: Python looks for a module in sys.modules \(already imported\), then in the folder of the running script \(sys.path[0]\), then the other folders listed in sys.path \(PYTHONPATH, standard library, site-packages\) - the first match wins. So milkrate.py must be in the same folder as the script \(or in a folder on sys.path\), and you should not name your file like a standard module \(e.g. math.py\) because it would be found first.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
