/T (4. Can it support 150,000 farmers? Yes for computation. Measured: 150,000 entries are priced in about 0.39 s \(2.6 microseconds per entry, growing linearly: 300 -> 0.8 ms, 6,000 -> 14.6 ms\). One ten-day cycle for 150,000 farmers is about 150,000 x 20 = 3,000,000 entries, estimated by linear extrapolation at about 8 seconds, which is acceptable for a batch)
