/Title (Still appropriate: named constants \(concept\), the separate module, the small functions \(rate_per_litre, payout, ten_day_total\), range validation, rounding each payment, the automated tests. No longer appropriate: a single set of rate constants, whole-step rounding, float arithmetic, and a ten_day_total without bonus/season. The design structure is sound, so a modification \(not a complete redesign\) is justified.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
